Today's prevailing deadly weapons are ballistic.

19
00:01:38,820 --> 00:01:40,940
And with each new deadly innovation,

20
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:43,260
it becomes more challenging to stop them.

21
00:01:45,660 --> 00:01:49,300
At the Armor Holdings Test Range in Ontario, California,

22
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:52,660
ballistics expert Bob Weber and his team

23
00:01:52,661 --> 00:01:55,380
are testing soft armor vests for police departments.

24
